+## Scenario 1 — Diff discipline: comment-only, two files, verbatim move (SC-002; contract §3)
+
+**After implementing the change**, run:
+
+```powershell
+git status --porcelain
+git diff --numstat -- apps/cli/src/commands/execution/mod.rs apps/cli/src/commands/mcp/tools.rs
+git diff -U0 -- apps/cli/src/commands/execution/mod.rs apps/cli/src/commands/mcp/tools.rs |
+  Select-String -Pattern '^[+-]' | Where-Object { $_ -notmatch '^(\+\+\+|---)' } |
+  Where-Object { $_ -notmatch '^[+-]\s*///' }
+```
+
+**Expected outcome**:
+- `git status --porcelain` shows exactly two modified source files (` M apps/cli/.../execution/mod.rs`, ` M apps/cli/.../mcp/tools.rs`) plus the untracked feature artifacts — no other path (FR-004).
+- numstat reports `11 11` for `execution/mod.rs` and `4 4` for `tools.rs` — equal added/removed counts per file (contract §3.3).
