+## Scenario 2 — Attachment: each block renders only on its own function (SC-001; contract §1)
+
+```powershell
+Select-String -Path apps\cli\src\commands\execution\mod.rs -Pattern 'pub\(crate\) fn (addressable_scope|repository_scope)\(' -Context 3,0
+Select-String -Path apps\cli\src\commands\mcp\tools.rs     -Pattern 'fn (assign_schema|synthesize_schema)\(\)'      -Context 3,0
