+## Notes
+
+- [P] = different files and no dependency on an incomplete task; here it flags the US1∥US2 launch points.
+- [Story] maps each task to its user story for traceability back to FR/SC in `spec.md`.
+- Every story is independently completable and testable (US3 being the cross-cutting exception that needs US1+US2).
+- Comment-only discipline (FR-004/FR-005) and the per-file `11==11` / `4==4` permutation invariant bound every edit task.
+- Commit after each story (or logical group); stop at any checkpoint to validate that story independently.
+- Avoid: rewording/splitting any moved line, editing either file's non-comment lines, touching any third file, or adding a separating blank line inside a comment run.
